{"id":"7383d8070afb35df","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-robinson-consistency.md","title":"Robinson's Consistency Theorem","display":"Robinson's Consistency Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-thm-robinson-consistency","aliases":["93-thm-robinson-consistency"],"display":"Robinson's Consistency Theorem","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-language]]","[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","[[93-df-first-order-structure]]","[[93-df-first-order-elementary-equivalence]]","[[93-df-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-robinson-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-robinson-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Robinson's Consistency Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30a8f872911e731f\" href=\"?note=30a8f872911e731f\" title=\"93-df-first-order-theory\">93-df-first-order-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ce709e0d2857990\" href=\"?note=0ce709e0d2857990\" title=\"93-df-first-order-structure\">93-df-first-order-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"78b7d00191e845b3\" href=\"?note=78b7d00191e845b3\" title=\"93-df-first-order-elementary-equivalence\">93-df-first-order-elementary-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" href=\"?note=2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" title=\"93-df-model\">93-df-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-robinson-consistency-—-Robinson's-Consistency-Theorem\">thm-robinson-consistency — Robinson's Consistency Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOCompat}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2,\\mathcal L_{12})\">\\(\\mathrm{FOCompat}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2,\\mathcal L_{12})\\)</span> fixes compatible intersection and union languages.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T_i;\\mathcal L_i)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T_i;\\mathcal L_i)\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{1,2\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{1,2\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>First-order reduct, model, and elementary-equivalence predicates have their local source signatures.</li>\n<li>In particular, these predicates are <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOElemEq}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOElemEq}_{93}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOCompat}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2,\\mathcal L_{12})\n\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T_1;\\mathcal L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T_2;\\mathcal L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T_1\\cup T_2;\\mathcal L_{12})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{2em}\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,T_1;\\mathcal L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak C,T_2;\\mathcal L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\mathrm{FOElemEq}_{93}\n(\\mathfrak B\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0,\n\\mathfrak C\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0;\\mathcal L_0)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOCompat}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2,\\mathcal L_{12})\n\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T_1;\\mathcal L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T_2;\\mathcal L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl[\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T_1\\cup T_2;\\mathcal L_{12})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{2em}\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,T_1;\\mathcal L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak C,T_2;\\mathcal L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\mathrm{FOElemEq}_{93}\n(\\mathfrak B\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0,\n\\mathfrak C\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0;\\mathcal L_0)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Joint satisfiability is characterized by models whose explicitly formed common-language reducts are elementarily equivalent. No propositional consistency predicate is reused.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-robinson-consistency-—-Robinson's-Consistency-Theorem","text":"thm-robinson-consistency — Robinson's Consistency Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"cc9bc888c7dda430","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-theory","status":"resolved","id":"30a8f872911e731f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-structure","status":"resolved","id":"0ce709e0d2857990","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-elementary-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"78b7d00191e845b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-elementary-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"2e6273b8ebf2e31a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-model]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOCompat}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2,\\mathcal L_{12})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T_i;\\mathcal L_i)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOElemEq}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{FOCompat}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2,\\mathcal L_{12})\n\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T_1;\\mathcal L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T_2;\\mathcal L_2)\\\\\n&\\to\\Bigl[\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T_1\\cup T_2;\\mathcal L_{12})\\\\\n&\\hspace{2em}\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak B,T_1;\\mathcal L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak C,T_2;\\mathcal L_2)\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\land\\mathrm{FOElemEq}_{93}\n(\\mathfrak B\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0,\n\\mathfrak C\\upharpoonright_{93}\\mathcal L_0;\\mathcal L_0)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1736,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["cc9bc888c7dda430","30a8f872911e731f","0ce709e0d2857990","78b7d00191e845b3","2e6273b8ebf2e31a"]}